"bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"02c12678-59fd-4b53-a372-b4764e7d8c65","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":function GetVisual() abort\n  let s = getcharpos(\"'\u0026lt;\")\n  let e = getcharpos(\"'\u0026gt;\")\n  let line = getline(s[1])\n  return strcharpart(line, s[2] - 1, e[2] - s[2] + 1)\nendfunction\n\" (↑ 1 行のみ対応のコード。複数行選択の実装は省略。やろうと思えばできる)","ts":"1631188236.062900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UZT+6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0908b05b-47b1-4d21-8661-d8fd8f5f6af3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ビジュアル選択の範囲取得、yank する以外の方法だと Vim 8.2.2324 で `getcharpos()` が入ったので、char-wise なら yank しなくてもいけそう","ts":"1631188195.062200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I9Gt"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nstrptime({format}, {timestring})                                *strptime()*\n                結果は数値で、{format} で指定した書式に一致する {timestring} が\n                表す日付と時刻の unix タイムスタンプを返す。\n \n                受け入れられる {format} はシステムに依存するため、これは移植可\n                能ではない! 書式は C 関数 strptime() のマニュアルページを参照\n                すること。特に \"%c\" は避けること。$TZ の値も影響する。\n \n                {timestring} が {format} でパースできないときは 0 が返される。\n                {timestring} の書式が分からないときは、非 0 の値が返るまで、異\n                なった {format} の値を試してみるとよい。\n \n                |strftime()| も参照。\n                例:  \n                  :echo strptime(\"%Y %b %d %X\", \"1997 Apr 27 11:49:23\")\n                  862156163  \n                  :echo strftime(\"%c\", strptime(\"%y%m%d %T\", \"970427 11:53:55\"))\n                  Sun Apr 27 11:53:55 1997  \n                  :echo strftime(\"%c\", strptime(\"%Y%m%d%H%M%S\", \"19970427115355\") + 3600)\n                  Sun Apr 27 12:53:55 1997\n \n                全システムで使用可能ではない。調べるにはこれを使う:  \n                        :if exists(\"*strptime\")\n```","ts":"1631173952.060800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"3D8D4F37-6B50-4882-87B2-218B8A3BFEB8","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":":h strptime()","ts":"1631173951.060700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P4=C"}]}]
